1
00:00:03,300 --> 00:00:08,446
On the Contacts list, the search box matches a name or a phone number.

2
00:00:08,446 --> 00:00:11,560
Type a name, such as Elena, to find her.

3
00:00:12,042 --> 00:00:16,206
Type three digits or more, such as seven zero two five five five,

4
00:00:16,206 --> 00:00:20,252
and the list shows contacts whose main number begins with them.

5
00:00:20,843 --> 00:00:23,094
Search terms are more precise.

6
00:00:23,094 --> 00:00:28,910
Phone matches digits anywhere, Phone Ends matches the last digits, Phone Starts matches

7
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:34,288
the first digits, and Phone Exact matches the whole number however it was saved.

8
00:00:34,288 --> 00:00:39,103
The Filter syntax entry of the Filters menu shows them on a Phone card.

